      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DANCE FIGHTER (2) has been a bit hot and cold and that continued last start when she finished third, beaten 22 metres, in a better performance at Geelong over 2100m. Has the benefit of a good draw. Meets a comparable field and she can find her way to the winners' stall. JUST ME AND YOU (7) scored at Kilmore three runs ago. Returned to something like that form last time out when third over 2180m there, beaten 7 metres. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position but is good enough to win a race of this calibre. I CHOOSE YOU (5) ended last prep with a seventh at Menangle over 2300m four-and-a-half months ago. This easier and can open this campaign with a more positive effort. ARGYLE MUSE (1) showed pleasing improvement last time out when third over 1710m at this track. Top-three credentials from the coveted pegs draw.",
